  "phase1_raw": "{\n  \"has_chain\": true,\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"jurisprudence\",\n    \"family\"\n  ],\n  \"content_type\": \"legal_ruling\",\n  \"chunks\": [\n    {\n      \"chunk_type\": \"isnad\",\n      \"arabic_text\": \"أَبُو عَلِيٍّ الْأَشْعَرِيُّ عَنْ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَبْدِ الْجَبَّارِ وَ مُحَمَّدُ بْنُ إِسْمَاعِيلَ عَنِ الْفَضْلِ بْنِ شَاذَانَ جَمِيعاً عَنْ صَفْوَانَ بْنِ يَحْيَى عَنْ مُعَاوِيَةَ بْنِ عَمَّارٍ عَنْ صَبَّاحِ بْنِ سَيَابَةَ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) قَالَ\",\n      \"translations\": {\n        \"en\": \"Abu Ali Al-Ash'ari from Muhammad ibn Abd al-Jabbar and Muhammad ibn Ismail from al-Fadl ibn Shadhan, all from Safwan ibn Yahya from Muawiya ibn Ammar from Sabbah ibn Sayyab from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him) who said:\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"chunk_type\": \"body\",\n      \"arabic_text\": \"لَا بَأْسَ بِالرَّضْعَةِ وَ الرَّضْعَتَيْنِ وَ الثَّلَاثِ\",\n      \"translations\": {\n        \"en\": \"There is no problem with the breast-feeding, and the two breast-feedings, and the three.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"translations\": {\n    \"en\": {\n      \"summary\": \"This hadith establishes the legal ruling regarding the limits of breast-feeding (radha') that create a prohibition of marriage (mahram). It confirms that one, two, or three breast-feedings are sufficient to establish this kinship tie, without requiring a specific number of distinct feedings beyond these counts.\",\n      \"seo_question\": \"How many breast-feedings are required to make marriage prohibited in Shia jurisprudence?\",\n      \"key_terms\": {\n        \"الرَّضْعَة\": \"Aَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْةَْة